      50.88,
      446.24,
      318.91,
      527.57
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      529.03,
      281.4,
      545.83
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      547.28,
      286.65,
      591.92
    ],
    "text": "The Land called in Final Village Plan No.51(FVP No.51) Situated at Saputhanthrikanda Grama Niladhari division in Walasmulla Divisional Secretarial area in Hambantota District in Southern province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.28,
      593.36,
      159.0,
      633.72
    ],
    "text": "Scheduled on follows:- Lot No. 266",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      633.71,
      286.64,
      659.84
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Purana Kumbura; Land use: Garden, Two permanent buildings, Three permanent",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.64,
      584.24,
      391.28
    ],
    "text": "toilets, One permanent Shrine; Owner: K. S. Advin, H. A. Nikulas, W. A. Karunasena, K. Charliss, H. Piyasena, H. P. Gunapala, P. P. Gunapala; Extent: 0.1267 Hec.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      392.44,
      539.4,
      530.23
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitudes is to be acquired* are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat office Walasmulla on the day of 21st July 2016, at 10.30 a.m.and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 24th day of June, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
